<node id="Prompt Engineering">
  <data key="d0">Prompt Engineering</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Prompt engineering is a core topic of the training, involving the design, optimization, and application of efficient prompts for specific financial scenarios.&lt;SEP&gt;The practice of designing effective prompts (instructions) for Large Language Models.&lt;SEP&gt;A method involving designing, testing, and optimizing prompts for large language models, including techniques like Chain-of-Thought and Few-shot learning.</data>
