<node id="Tool Use">
  <data key="d0">Tool Use</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Tool Use, or Function Calling, is a mechanism for LLMs to call external APIs or generate code, such as for real-time stock price queries.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6c9699f6be450b7bab348fd80cc8c912</data>
  <data key="d4">llm_course.pdf</data>
